        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Using the standard algorithm, we can calculate the difference between two numbers containing any number of digits.</p>",
            "readable_text": "Using the standard algorithm, we can calculate the difference between two numbers containing any number of digits.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Let&#x27;s use the standard algorithm to compute the following difference:</p>",
            "readable_text": "Let's use the standard algorithm to compute the following difference:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 42,345 - 3,124]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: 42,345 - 3,124]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>First, we line up our numbers (ones over ones, tens over tens, hundreds over hundreds, and so on):</p>",
            "readable_text": "First, we line up our numbers (ones over ones, tens over tens, hundreds over hundreds, and so on):",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 4|2|3|4|5; \u2212|3|1|2|4]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: 4|2|3|4|5; \u2212|3|1|2|4]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Next, we proceed by subtracting the numbers in each place value from right to left, borrowing where needed.</p>",
            "readable_text": "Next, we proceed by subtracting the numbers in each place value from right to left, borrowing where needed.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3|12; 4|2|3|4|5; \u2212|3|1|2|4; 3|9|2|2|1]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: 3|12; 4|2|3|4|5; \u2212|3|1|2|4; 3|9|2|2|1]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Therefore, </p>",
